2026-10-13T10:21:37.0736686Z Run the POSIX AIO store benchmark.
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0736856Z 
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0736930Z options:
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0737162Z   -h, --help            show this help message and exit
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0737638Z   -w WORKER_NUMBER, --worker-number WORKER_NUMBER
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0738008Z                         worker number: number of worker processes to start
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0738687Z                         concurrently.
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0738950Z   -s SHARD_SIZE, --shard-size SHARD_SIZE
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0739279Z                         shard size: POSIX store I/O size. In layerwise mode,
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0739658Z                         this is the K/V tensor size for one layer of one
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0740031Z                         block. In non-layerwise mode, this is the K/V tensor
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0740385Z                         size for all layers of one block.
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0740688Z   -n SHARD_NUMBER, --shard-number SHARD_NUMBER
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0741035Z                         shard number: number of layers in layerwise mode; use
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0741534Z                         1 in non-layerwise mode.
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0741834Z   -b BLOCK_NUMBER, --block-number BLOCK_NUMBER
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0742139Z                         block number: total number of blocks.
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0742497Z   -d DUMP_EPOCH_NUMBER, --dump-epoch-number DUMP_EPOCH_NUMBER
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0742865Z                         dump epoch number: number of dump epochs.
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0743223Z   -l LOAD_EPOCH_NUMBER, --load-epoch-number LOAD_EPOCH_NUMBER
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0743583Z                         load epoch number: number of load epochs.
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0743923Z   -o STORAGE_BACKEND, --storage-backend STORAGE_BACKEND
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0744277Z                         storage backend: storage backend path; may be
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0744582Z                         repeated.
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0744903Z   --model MODEL         model directory (or config.json) for model-driven
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0745311Z                         mode. When set, shard-size/shard-number/block-number
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0745708Z                         are computed from the model config and override any
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0746047Z                         manually provided values.
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0746642Z   --tp TP               tensor parallel size; divides num_kv_heads per rank
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0746994Z                         for GQA.
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0747224Z   --input-len INPUT_LEN
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0747505Z                         request input length; block_number = ceil(input_len /
