2026-10-13T10:21:37.0748086Z   --layerwise, --no-layerwise
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0748381Z                         layerwise mode: one shard = one layer (default true;
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0748772Z                         --no-layerwise for non-layerwise, one shard = all
