2026-10-13T10:21:37.0750295Z   --kv-dtype KV_DTYPE   override KV dtype: bfloat16/bf16, float16/fp16,
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0750700Z                         float32/fp32, float8_e4m3fn/fp8, float8_e5m2, int8.
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0751058Z                         Default: config torch_dtype or bfloat16.
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0751433Z   --posix-data-trans-concurrency POSIX_DATA_TRANS_CONCURRENCY
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0751835Z                         posix data transfer concurrency (psync worker count).
