2026-10-13T10:21:37.0752407Z   --posix-io-engine {psync,aio}
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0752693Z                         posix io engine: psync or aio. Default aio.
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0753003Z   --io-direct, --no-io-direct
2026-10-13T10:21:37.0753318Z                         use O_DIRECT for aligned file I/O (default true; --no-
